 based on that. Perhaps I should read through the message thread for context. The user asked me to find the budget spreadsheet and provide the link, which I can get from URL search results. I'll also read the email contents and any relevant event info from the calendar.\"}]},{\"type\":\"custom_tool_call\",\"id\":\"ctc_0975f5cd16945df3016af127e5074887d0a495c0fb0992a81c\",\"call_id\":\"call_voz5dgjHaSu1bGZSgF8LIqIm\",\"name\":\"codemode\",\"input\":\"const r = await tools.mail({command:\\\"read\\\",message:\\\"msg_60563e7695bd423d\\\"});\\ntext(r);\\n\"},{\"type\":\"custom_tool_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_voz5dgjHaSu1bGZSgF8LIqIm\",\"output\":\"Script completed\\nWall time 0.0 seconds\\nOutput:\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_60563e7695bd423d\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_ed7f05b705364b0f\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"body\\\": {\\n        \\\"text\\\": \\\"Hi Sam,\\\\n\\\\nCan you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review? Finance wants the Q3 travel line.\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nDana\\\",\\n        \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n        \\\"limit_chars\\\": 20000\\n      },\\n      \\\"attachments\\\": []\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"id\":\"rs_0975f5cd16945df3016af127e5f2e887d09956a1ce08b3e73d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":